      "cooked": "<p>Kismet as ruler as seen from the card Fortune’s smile.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-286-writers-room-disparation-vol-2-58\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-286-writers-room-disparation-vol-2-58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-286-writers-room-disparation-vol-2-58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #286 - Writers' Room: Disparation Vol. 2 #58</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We're off to another world!   Show Notes: Run Time: 1:52:48 We hit the ground running with this one, and I've got IDEAS! Do they pan out? Wait and see! Another thrilling tale from the pages of Disparation, just in time for July, which will be...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f7246875795a872762b99a9298a0bdf08a980d25.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/f7246875795a872762b99a9298a0bdf08a980d25\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f7246875795a872762b99a9298a0bdf08a980d25_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zgjWdNd3axgNM4Ee5xFS55dmJI9\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f7246875795a872762b99a9298a0bdf08a980d25_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploa