      "id": 259541,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-06-26T11:01:56.751Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"30901\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So Kismet/Ermine teamup story, yes?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It is, I admit, perhaps an odd connection to make in my mind. But they always felt to me like they had similar vibes: The stylishly attractive ex-girlfriend/ex-social “friend” who has a personal rivalry with a hero for an ultimately goofy reason that’s wholly their own fault, and a greedy, petty, and selfish personality.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Escher\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"30901\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/escher/48/4865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Escher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That implies that Pete was a real piece of work in that universe and totally deserved to get cursed with bad luck.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Along those lines, while I know it was done for iconic look reasons, Expat’s eyepatch also raises some questions.</p>",
